    <item>
      <title>Ինչպէ՞ս Վանա լիճը «սառեցուց» պատմութիւնը</title>
      <link>https://westernarmeniatv.com/history_wa/patrimony-history_wa/%d5%ab%d5%b6%d5%b9%d5%ba%d5%a7%d5%9e%d5%bd-%d5%be%d5%a1%d5%b6%d5%a1-%d5%ac%d5%ab%d5%b3%d5%a8-%d5%bd%d5%a1%d5%bc%d5%a5%d6%81%d5%b8%d6%82%d6%81-%d5%ba%d5%a1%d5%bf%d5%b4%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a9/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25d5%25ab%25d5%25b6%25d5%25b9%25d5%25ba%25d5%25a7%25d5%259e%25d5%25bd-%25d5%25be%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b6%25d5%25a1-%25d5%25ac%25d5%25ab%25d5%25b3%25d5%25a8-%25d5%25bd%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bc%25d5%25a5%25d6%2581%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d6%2581-%25d5%25ba%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bf%25d5%25b4%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a9</link>
      <description>Վանա լիճը, որ կը գտնուի Արեւմտեան Հայաստանի մէջ, յաճախ կը կոչուի շրջանի «ամենաայլմոլորակային» ջրաւազանը։ Ան ո՛չ քաղցրահամ է, ո՛չ ալ The post Ինչպէ՞ս Վանա լիճը «սառեցուց» պատմութիւնը first appeared on Western Armenia TV.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://westernarmeniatv.com/history_wa/patrimony-history_wa/%d5%ab%d5%b6%d5%b9%d5%ba%d5%a7%d5%9e%d5%bd-%d5%be%d5%a1%d5%b6%d5%a1-%d5%ac%d5%ab%d5%b3%d5%a8-%d5%bd%d5%a1%d5%bc%d5%a5%d6%81%d5%b8%d6%82%d6%81-%d5%ba%d5%a1%d5%bf%d5%b4%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a9/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25d5%25ab%25d5%25b6%25d5%25b9%25d5%25ba%25d5%25a7%25d5%259e%25d5%25bd-%25d5%25be%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b6%25d5%25a1-%25d5%25ac%25d5%25ab%25d5%25b3%25d5%25a8-%25d5%25bd%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bc%25d5%25a5%25d6%2581%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d6%2581-%25d5%25ba%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bf%25d5%25b4%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a9</guid>
